          "kicker": "Winning start",
          "heading": "Jake White's Fiji beat Japan 34-28 as Ben Volavola's penalties seal win",
          "body": "Jake White's first Test in charge ended in a 34-28 win over Japan in Tokyo on Saturday. The win reversed September's Pacific Nations Cup final, lost 20-15 to Japan. Both teams scored three first-half tries, and substitute Ben Volavola settled it with two penalties after the break. White picked no Europe-based players and handed out four new caps, and he says Fiji \"can beat anyone\" on their day."
