          "heading": "Borthwick could call George Barton and Nathan Jibulu into November squad",
          "body": "Planet Rugby has named seven uncapped players Steve Borthwick could draft into England's November Tests, and Gloucester full-back George Barton heads the case, its writer arguing his form has pushed him into the picture. Sale hooker Nathan Jibulu is another name to watch: two man-of-the-match displays this season, and Jamie George is nearing the end of his Test career. England's block also features Australia, Japan and the All Blacks."
