          "heading": "Andy Farrell names 36-man Ireland squad for November Test window",
          "body": "Andy Farrell has named a 36-man squad for Ireland's November Test window, with Argentina the next opponent, and The42 Rugby Weekly has been picking over the selections. The same week carries a big interpro, with a blockbuster Leinster-Munster URC clash in Dublin. Planet Rugby's Ulster ratings, meanwhile, called Stuart McCloskey's display a 'statement performance' that puts Farrell on notice just before the Nations Championship."
