          "heading": "Italy lost 32-14 at home to South Africa in November 2025",
          "body": "Italy lost 32-14 at home to South Africa in November 2025, in an International Friendly. That is a single result, not a head-to-head record, so it does not establish a wider pattern between the sides. Italy's own run is the more pressing number: across the last three games in the log they have lost every one, conceding 131 points. The next meeting is Round 4 of the Nations Championship."
