          "kicker": "Court case",
          "heading": "Former Scotland winger Tim Visser to go on trial charged with rape",
          "body": "Tim Visser, capped 33 times by Scotland as a winger between 2012 and 2017, is to go on trial accused of controlling, abusing and raping a woman. The 39-year-old faces four charges spanning 14 years, from 2010 to 2024, two of which allege rape, including sex after consent was withdrawn. He has entered a not-guilty plea at a hearing in the High Court in Glasgow, and the trial is set for January 2028 in Edinburgh."
        },
