          "heading": "Les Kiss names 33-man spring squad with Tom Lambert among new faces",
          "body": "Les Kiss has named a 33-man squad for the spring tour, and the new faces are the story. Prop Tom Lambert is in as a newcomer alongside Teddy Wilson, while centre Len Ikitau is back from injury. Tupou and Hooper return too, after Australia were without them against New Zealand because those Tests fell outside the global player release window. Ryan Lonergan is the standout No. 9, with Wilson and Tate McDermott pushing for the back-up spot."
