          "heading": "Dentsu returns to acquire Rugby World Cup 2027 rights in Japan",
          "body": "Dentsu is returning to acquire the rights to Rugby World Cup 2027 in Japan, a bid that determines how the men's tournament is shown to Japanese fans. The bid itself is the news; the terms and any rivals remain unclear. Meanwhile the team is on the back foot, sitting 10 of 12 on the log after losing to Fiji, with the next Test a trip to Wales in Round four."
