          "heading": "Captain Ardie Savea among All Blacks unavailable for Europe tour",
          "body": "Captain Ardie Savea is among the All Blacks unavailable for the Europe tour, with a shoulder injury adding to a growing list. Wing Leroy Carter was ruled out after ankle surgery following a hip-drop tackle in the first Bledisloe Cup Test in Auckland, and Ruben Love, Luke Jacobson, Caleb Clarke, Billy Proctor, Ollie Norris and Tamaiti Williams are also unavailable. The tour takes in Scotland, England and Wales before the Twickenham finals weekend."
